{
    "____comment": "CryptoBingo Smart Contract ABI — v3.0 — Gerado manualmente. Sincronizado com bingo.hpp Sprint 2026-05-26 (FSM Completa, Campaigns B2B, GC). Ref: ADR-004, ADR-005, ADR-008.",
