            ]
        }

    ],

    "actions": [
        { "name": "setconfig",     "type": "setconfig",     "ricardian_contract": "<h1 class=\"contract\">setconfig</h1>\n### Intent\nThe purpose of `setconfig` is to initialize or update the cryptographic signing authority of the off-chain microservice.\n\n### Terms\nI, the contract administrator, declare that by submitting the public key {{signer_key}}, I formally authorize the corresponding microservice to cryptographically sign ticket matrices generated off-chain. This key shall be the sole authority accepted by `assert_recover_key` within the `buytickets` action." },

        { "name": "creategame",    "type": "creategame",    "ricardian_contract": "<h1 class=\"contract\">creategame</h1>\n### Intent\nThe purpose of `creategame` is to schedule a new autonomous bingo round in the `created` state.\n\n### Terms\nI, the contract administrator, declare that by instantiating game {{game_id}} with ticket price {{ticket_price}} under gametype {{gametype_id}}, the contract allocates a new state entry with initial status `created`. The game will not accept ticket purchases until `fundgame` is invoked by the microservice. I declare that the treasury holds sufficient liquidity to cover potential payouts for this round based on the Law of Large Numbers." },

        { "name": "fundgame",      "type": "fundgame",      "ricardian_contract": "<h1 class=\"contract\">fundgame</h1>\n### Intent\nThe purpose of `fundgame` is to open ticket sales for a scheduled game, transitioning it from `created` to `funding`.\n\n### Terms\nThis action, authorized by the microservice account, transitions game {{game_id}} from `created` to `funding`. From this moment, players may purchase tickets. The microservice assumes responsibility for invoking `lockgame` within the scheduled time window." },

        { "name": "lockgame",      "type": "lockgame",      "ricardian_contract": "<h1 class=\"contract\">lockgame</h1>\n### Intent\nThe purpose of `lockgame` is to freeze ticket sales for an active game, transitioning it from `funding` to `locked`.\n\n### Terms\nThis action, authorized by the microservice account, transitions game {{game_id}} from `funding` to `locked`. No new tickets will be accepted from this moment forward, protecting the mathematical consensus of the imminent draw." },

        { "name": "startdraw",     "type": "startdraw",     "ricardian_contract": "<h1 class=\"contract\">startdraw</h1>\n### Intent\nThe purpose of `startdraw` is to formally request provably fair randomness from the WAX network oracle.\n\n### Terms\nThis action transitions game {{game_id}} to `drawing` status and dispatches an inline asynchronous request to the `orng.wax` system contract, using the game ID as the association seed. The draw result is exclusively determined by the oracle's entropy and cannot be influenced by the operator." },

        { "name": "receiverand",   "type": "receiverand",   "ricardian_contract": "<h1 class=\"contract\">receiverand</h1>\n### Intent\nThe purpose of this action is to receive and permanently record the official entropy vector generated by the external oracle.\n\n### Terms\nThis action exclusively accepts requests originating from the `orng.wax` system contract. The injected bytes are recorded immutably as the official draw result for game {{assoc_id}}, transitioning its status to `drawn`. The 75-ball sequence derived from this entropy is the sole basis for win evaluation." },

        { "name": "claimwin",      "type": "claimwin",      "ricardian_contract": "<h1 class=\"contract\">claimwin</h1>\n### Intent\nThe purpose of `claimwin` is to audit a winning ticket via Boolean algebra (bitmasking O(1)) and credit the fixed-odds prize to the corresponding player.\n\n### Terms\nThis action, invoked under microservice authorization, validates that ticket {{ticket_id}} in game {{game_id}} has satisfied the win pattern mask {{win_pattern_mask}} given {{ball_count}} officially drawn balls. The contract applies the applicable gametype multipliers and credits the net prize amount instantly to the winner's internal balance. The game status transitions to `archived` and `end_time` is recorded to initiate the 24-hour quarantine period." },

        { "name": "abortgame",     "type": "abortgame",     "ricardian_contract": "<h1 class=\"contract\">abortgame</h1>\n### Intent\nThe purpose of `abortgame` is to activate the fail-safe mechanism when the oracle does not respond within the allowed window or when an administrative halt is required.\n\n### Terms\nThis action transitions game {{game_id}} to `aborted` status with reason {{reason}} and records `end_time`. From this moment, `refundticket` becomes available to all participants. The operator declares that no player funds will be retained under an aborted game and that full refunds shall be processed." },

        { "name": "refundticket",  "type": "refundticket",  "ricardian_contract": "<h1 class=\"contract\">refundticket</h1>\n### Intent\nThe purpose of `refundticket` is to provide an O(1) self-service refund mechanism for players when a game is aborted, without requiring platform intervention.\n\n### Terms\nThis action may be invoked by any account. It verifies that game {{game_id}} is in `aborted` status, credits the `ticket_price` of ticket {{ticket_id}} to the owner's internal balance, and permanently erases the ticket row from the contract's RAM. Players retain full autonomy to claim their refund even if the platform is offline." },

        { "name": "cleargame",     "type": "cleargame",     "ricardian_contract": "<h1 class=\"contract\">cleargame</h1>\n### Intent\nThe purpose of `cleargame` is to release contract RAM by erasing ticket rows after the mandatory 24-hour quarantine period (for archived games) or immediately (for aborted games).\n\n### Terms\nThis action erases up to {{max_rows}} ticket rows from game {{game_id}} in a single call to respect the WAX block CPU budget (~30ms). It must be called repeatedly until no rows remain. For `archived` games, the 24-hour quarantine after `end_time` must have elapsed. Upon full erasure, the game entry itself is also removed, returning all allocated RAM to the treasury." },

        { "name": "setnftconf",    "type": "setnftconf",    "ricardian_contract": "<h1 class=\"contract\">setnftconf</h1>\n### Intent\nThe purpose of `setnftconf` is to dynamically map utility rights of an AtomicAssets NFT template to in-game benefits.\n\n### Terms\nI associate template {{template_id}} with a {{discount_pct}}% discount on ticket purchases. This benefit is valid until timestamp {{valid_until}} (where 0 represents a perpetual benefit), and VIP status is set to {{is_vip}}." },

        { "name": "delnftconf",    "type": "delnftconf",    "ricardian_contract": "<h1 class=\"contract\">delnftconf</h1>\n### Intent\nThe purpose of `delnftconf` is to revoke the on-chain utility of a specific NFT template.\n\n### Terms\nI, the contract administrator, permanently remove the promotional rights of template {{template_id}}. From this consensus block forward, ownership of this NFT shall not grant discounts on new ticket purchases." },

        { "name": "addpattern",    "type": "addpattern",    "ricardian_contract": "<h1 class=\"contract\">addpattern</h1>\n### Intent\nThe purpose of `addpattern` is to register or update a bitmask corresponding to a geometric win pattern for the bingo game.\n\n### Terms\nBy submitting identifier {{pattern_id}} with descriptive name {{name}} and bitmask {{mask}}, I establish a geometric validation invariant in the contract for O(1) payout calculation. The mask must not exceed 25 bits, corresponding to the 5x5 bingo card layout." },

        { "name": "delpattern",    "type": "delpattern",    "ricardian_contract": "<h1 class=\"contract\">delpattern</h1>\n### Intent\nThe purpose of `delpattern` is to revoke a registered geometric win pattern.\n\n### Terms\nI, the contract administrator, permanently remove pattern {{pattern_id}} from the global game state. New rounds will not compute payouts against this bitmask." },

        { "name": "addgametype",   "type": "addgametype",   "ricardian_contract": "<h1 class=\"contract\">addgametype</h1>\n### Intent\nThe purpose of `addgametype` is to register or update a game mode that consolidates economic rules, base multipliers and win pattern weights.\n\n### Terms\nBy registering gametype {{gametype_id}} under the name {{name}} with base multiplier {{base_multiplier}}, I authorize the treasury to be exposed financially according to the indexed rules and weights. The payout formula is: ticket_price × base_multiplier × max_pattern_weight (max-weight rule, ADR-005)." },

        { "name": "delgametype",   "type": "delgametype",   "ricardian_contract": "<h1 class=\"contract\">delgametype</h1>\n### Intent\nThe purpose of `delgametype` is to remove a game mode from active configurations.\n\n### Terms\nI remove gametype {{gametype_id}} from the contract's active configurations. Existing games linked to this type are not affected, but no new games may be created under it." },

        { "name": "buytickets",    "type": "buytickets",    "ricardian_contract": "<h1 class=\"contract\">buytickets</h1>\n### Intent\nThe purpose of `buytickets` is to allow a player to acquire legitimate bingo tickets by debiting their custodied internal balance.\n\n### Terms\nI, {{buyer}}, authorize the deduction of the total ticket cost for game {{game_id}} from my internal balance table in this contract. If I provided NFT {{nft_id}}, I acknowledge that the applicable dynamic discount rules will be enforced by the contract. I accept that the integrity of my ticket matrices depends on the cryptographic signature validation of the backend's authorized key registered via `setconfig`." },

        { "name": "linkcampaign",  "type": "linkcampaign",  "ricardian_contract": "<h1 class=\"contract\">linkcampaign</h1>\n### Intent\nThe purpose of `linkcampaign` is to inject a sponsor's per-game payout allocation into a game's sponsor pool, establishing a trustless B2B sponsorship.\n\n### Terms\nBy linking campaign {{campaign_id}} to game {{game_id}}, the `payout_per_game` amount is transferred from the campaign's remaining balance into the game's `sponsor_pool`. This action requires the game to be in `created` or `funding` status. The sponsor's funds are committed and will be distributed to the winning ticket holder upon `claimwin`, or returned according to `leftover_policy` upon `closecampaign`." },

        { "name": "closecampaign", "type": "closecampaign", "ricardian_contract": "<h1 class=\"contract\">closecampaign</h1>\n### Intent\nThe purpose of `closecampaign` is to settle the residual balance of a B2B sponsorship campaign according to its pre-defined leftover policy.\n\n### Terms\nBy closing campaign {{campaign_id}}, the remaining balance is liquidated as follows: if `leftover_policy` is `refund`, the remaining tokens are transferred back to the sponsor account; if `leftover_policy` is `house`, the remaining tokens remain in the contract treasury. The campaign record is then permanently erased." },

        { "name": "withdraw",      "type": "withdraw",      "ricardian_contract": "<h1 class=\"contract\">withdraw</h1>\n### Intent\nThe purpose of `withdraw` is to liquidate and transfer funds from the contract's internal ledger to the user's native WAX network account.\n\n### Terms\nI, {{owner}}, instruct the contract to deduct exactly {{amount}} from my internal balance and dispatch an inline transfer transaction of the corresponding token to my external account." }
    ],

    "tables": [
        {
            "name": "config",
            "type": "config_state",
            "index_type": "i64",
            "key_names": [],
            "key_types": []
        },
        {
            "name": "balances",
            "type": "balance_record",
            "index_type": "i64",
            "key_names": ["primary_key"],
            "key_types": ["uint64"]
        },
        {
            "name": "games",
            "type": "game_state",
            "index_type": "i64",
