            "key_types": ["uint64"]
        },
        {
            "name": "campaigns",
            "type": "campaign_record",
            "index_type": "i64",
            "key_names":  ["campaign_id", "sponsor"],
            "key_types":  ["uint64",       "uint64"]
        }
    ],

    "ricardian_clauses": [
        {
            "id": "terms-of-service",
            "body": "### CryptoBingo — Terms of Service\n\nBy interacting with this contract, all parties agree to the following:\n\n1. **Provably Fair Randomness:** All draw outcomes are exclusively determined by the WAX RNG Oracle (`orng.wax`). The contract operator has no ability to influence, delay or manipulate draw results after `startdraw` is invoked.\n\n2. **Financial Segregation:** Player funds held in the `balances` table are cryptographically segregated. The contract's administrative key cannot execute withdrawals on behalf of players.\n\n3. **Return to Player (RTP):** The contractual RTP is either 85% of the prize pool (legacy mode) or `ticket_price × base_multiplier × max_pattern_weight` (dynamic gametype mode), as set by the gametype configuration. This formula is hardcoded and immutable per round.\n\n4. **Fail-Safe Protection:** In the event of oracle unavailability or an administrative halt, `abortgame` transitions the game to the `ABORTED` state. All participants retain the autonomous right to invoke `refundticket` for a full refund, independent of platform availability.\n\n5. **Compliance:** This contract operates under the framework of Brazilian Law 14.790/2023 (Fixed-Odds Betting). Financial transaction records are immutably stored in the WAX blockchain action logs and are available for regulatory audit in perpetuity.\n\n6. **RAM Governance:** Contract RAM is managed through the `cleargame` Garbage Collection mechanism. After a mandatory 24-hour quarantine following game resolution, RAM is released and returned to the treasury. This ensures long-term operational sustainability."
        },
        {
            "id": "dispute-resolution",
            "body": "### Dispute Resolution\n\nAll disputes regarding game outcomes must be submitted within 72 hours of the `claimwin` or `abortgame` action timestamp. Evidence must be based exclusively on on-chain action logs verifiable on the WAX blockchain explorer. The SHA-256 hash of the oracle's `random_bytes` payload serves as the definitive proof of draw integrity."
        }
    ],

    "variants": [],
    "action_results": []
}
